 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Privacy implementation
+
+- Shared documents do not load external analytics, ad scripts, or fonts. Branding uses system serif fonts.
+- Account forms send only username and password to the existing external authentication API after submission. Requests omit cookies and referrers, disable caching, and reject redirects. API error bodies and returned tokens are not consumed or stored; password fields clear after every completed attempt.
+- Forms explain the recipient and purpose, link the privacy notice, support password managers, and remain disabled until hydration to avoid accidental native submissions. Sign-in only validates credentials; a persistent authentication session is not implemented.
+- HTML responses carry `Referrer-Policy`, `X-Content-Type-Options`, and a restrictive camera/microphone/geolocation `Permissions-Policy`. Account documents additionally use `Cache-Control: no-store` and `X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow`. The HTML referrer meta tag also covers client-side navigation.
+- Middleware no longer eagerly initializes reading-list sessions. Reading-list API handlers retain their existing lazy read defaults and explicit writes.
+
+The external authentication service's retention, deletion, credential storage, and logging are outside this repository and require operator review. Article-specific demonstration scripts/cookies and externally hosted content remain; the privacy notice discloses these. These frontend changes do not establish site-wide regulatory compliance.
